            "action_name": {
              "value": "Drag Below"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(attack)\n\nThe elasmosaurus attempts an Athletics check against a grabbed foe's Fortitude DC. If the elasmosaurus succeeds, the foe is forcibly moved 5 feet toward the elasmosaurus's body. If the elasmosaurus critically succeeds, the foe is moved 10 feet towards the elasmosaurus's body."
            },
