            "action_name": {
              "value": "Thrashing Retreat"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "A swimming elasmosaurus thrashes the area around it as it attempts to flee.\n\nIt makes two paddle Strikes, each of which must be against separate targets, and each of which takes the normal multiple attack penalty. It then Swims up to its swim Speed. This Swim does not trigger reactions based on movement."
            },
